             P1's registered threshold is 0.058 (half the model's predicted swing of +0.115), which is ABOVE the MDE, so the design can see the effect it gates on.
             the sigma is ASSUMED and not measured here. scripts/replicate_noise_floor.py measures the real between-replicate spread; until it has run on a card every threshold on this page rests on an upper bound from another session.
